# Resolved dependency versions are per-environment.
#
# This is a LIBRARY, and CI resolves it on Julia 1.9, 1.10 and latest. A single
# committed Manifest.toml can only match the version that generated it, so the
# other two failed to instantiate ("Could not locate the source code for the
# OpenSSL_jll package. Are you trying to use a manifest generated by a different
# version of Julia?") — the Julia SDK gate had been red on that since 2026-05-07.
Manifest.toml
